WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
I knew from the beginning that you would definitely make it happen

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:03,040
Let me introduce you

3
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:04,520
This is my niece Wang Lei

4
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:06,290
She just graduated from college

5
00:00:06,530 --> 00:00:07,690
Didn't find a suitable job

6
00:00:07,970 --> 00:00:09,210
Want to try starting your own business

7
00:00:09,570 --> 00:00:12,130
So I'm going to free up this shop for her

8
00:00:12,570 --> 00:00:15,490
I might have to force you to move to another place, Brother Hai.

9
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:17,370
Isn't this a decent thing to do?

10
00:00:17,730 --> 00:00:22,210
As soon as I have some improvement here, you are going to let others directly take over my store Xiaolin.

11
00:00:22,450 --> 00:00:23,490
That's it

12
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,260
Can your business do well?

13
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:27,340
Isn’t it because my shop is in a good location?

14
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:30,600
Besides, the contract is very clearly written.

15
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:32,320
Just give one week's notice

16
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:35,550
If I take back the shop, it won't be considered a breach of contract.

17
00:00:35,750 --> 00:00:38,010
Don’t forget to move out within a week

18
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:39,530
This shop is mine

19
00:00:39,850 --> 00:00:40,810
you are just a tenant
